{"pin":"AB00696","subcodes":[{"code":"AB00696","anchor":"","first_line":"O thou who art steadfast in the Covenant! Thy detailed letter was received, yet due to the press of manifold occupations, a brief reply is being penned [3.5s]... ...You have asked as to the feast in every Baha’í month. This feast is held to foster comradeship and love","first_line_orig":"ای ثابت بر پیمان نامه مفصل شما رسید ولی از کثرت مشاغل جواب مختصر مرقوم میشود  ","language":"Per","word_count":"470","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_134BE #16 p.623","source":"AKHA_134BE #16 p.623","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AVK3.138.11x","source":"AVK3","locator":"138.11x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AK3/ak3-142.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT2.302","source":"MKT2","locator":"302","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA2/ma2-302.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MKT3.502","source":"MKT3","locator":"502","url":"https://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/ab/MA3/ma3-502.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#050 p.088x","source":"MMK1","locator":"050 p.088x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/294322652"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_CONSULT#16x","source":"BRL_CONSULT","locator":"16x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/178842202"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#0182x","source":"COC","locator":"0182x"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#0925x","source":"COC","locator":"0925x"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOG#0580x","source":"LOG","locator":"0580x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/hornby_lights_guidance.html\u0026chapter=2#n580"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWA